2605 0 obj
<<
/Title (2. "Saving a file to the server takes a minute at month-end": A coaxial bus and a Layer-1 hub form a single shared collision domain operating in half-duplex under CSMA/CD. At month-end, all 30 computers simultaneously upload large accounting files to the single server at the far end of the trunk, creating severe congestion, high collision rates, and exponential backoff delays.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2276 0 R
/Prev 2604 0 R
/Next 2441 0 R
>>
endobj
